{"t":"028260.KS","n":"Samsung C&T Corporation","nKo":"삼성물산","ex":"KSE","cur":"KRW","px":265500.0,"chg":19000.0,"chgPct":0.07708,"prev":246500.0,"dayH":268500.0,"dayL":255000.0,"w52H":565000.0,"w52L":213000.0,"vol":314458,"avgVol":279014,"mcap":43445137702912,"pe":null,"fpe":11.48,"eps":null,"feps":null,"pb":null,"div":2800.0,"divY":0.0114,"beta":1.29,"short":null,"shortPct":null,"shortRatio":null,"prof":{"c":"South Korea","cKo":"대한민국","s":"Industrials","sKo":"산업재","i":"Engineering & Construction","iKo":"엔지니어링 및 건설","city":"Seoul","emp":null,"web":"https://www.samsungcnt.com","sum":"Samsung C&T Corporation engages in the engineering and construction, trading and investment, fashion, and resort businesses in South Korea, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and the Americas. Its engineering and construction business cover building, civil infrastructure, plant, housing construction, electrical testing, commissioning, engineering, operations and maintenance, equipment hire, and calibration services. The company trades in chemicals such as polymers, fertilizers, methanol, general chemical, and mining materials; hot and cold-rolled, stainless steel, coated/colored steel, plates, and wire rods products; energy resources comprising renewable energy, biofuel, hydrogen, LNG power plants, and project organizing; and industrial materials, including component and process chemical, eq","sumKo":"삼성물산은 한국, 유럽, 중동, 아프리카, 미주 지역에서 엔지니어링 및 건설, 무역 및 투자, 패션, 리조트 사업을 영위하고 있습니다. 엔지니어링 및 건설 사업에는 건축, 토목 인프라, 플랜트, 주택 건설, 전기 테스트, 시운전, 엔지니어링, 운영 및 유지 관리, 장비 대여 및 교정 서비스가 포함됩니다. 이 회사는 폴리머, 비료, 메탄올, 일반 화학, 광산 재료와 같은 화학 물질을 거래합니다. 열간압연, 냉간압연, 스테인레스강, 코팅/착색강판, 후판, 선재제품; 재생 에너지, 바이오 연료, 수소, LNG 발전소 및 프로젝트 조직으로 구성된 에너지 자원; 부품, 공정화학물질 등 산업자재 등"},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":43161654000000,"ni":2044081000000},{"y":2023,"rev":41895681000000,"ni":2218290000000},{"y":2024,"rev":42103238000000,"ni":2230258000000},{"y":2025,"rev":40742241000000,"ni":2439114000000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":1083243300